 by the classic Zelda games, made up of beautiful but corrupted temples and shrines dotted all around the world of Atarassia, and befriend the spirits that live within. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/dc866821f4d0465d85b554ff42ab3034.poster.avif?t=1754628727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/dc866821f4d0465d85b554ff42ab3034.webm?t=1754628727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/dc866821f4d0465d85b554ff42ab3034.mp4?t=1754628727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Battle giant monsters in places that have been deeply corrupted by the Void and defeat them to free the surroundings at last.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/95d22e450ab69e9ea4bac5192cfe3e80.poster.avif?t=1754628727\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/95d22e450ab69e9ea4bac5192cfe3e80.webm?t=1754628727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638160/extras/95d22e450ab69e9ea4bac5192cfe3e80.mp4?t=1754628727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
